# ask_user_question with two questions, the second multi-select: the tab
# strip shows progress, space toggles options, and after the last question
# the review screen lists every answer before Submit. Claude Code shows the
# same review step ("Ready to submit your answers?") for more than one
# question.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-askuser-multi.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE plan the release
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Which scope should I take\?/ 20
SHOT q1-scope
EXPECT /Scope/
EXPECT /Checks/
KEY 2
WAITFOR /Which checks should block the merge\?/ 10
SHOT q2-checks-untoggled
KEY space
KEY down
KEY down
KEY space
SHOT q2-lint-and-e2e-toggled
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Review your answers/ 10
SHOT review
EXPECT /Everything/
EXPECT /Lint, E2E/
EXPECT /Submit answers/
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Answers received, starting now\./ 20
SHOT after-submit
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
